From 1e8e16e27ff39eb03c10ed8f44e39010f1d37152 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blank <583957236@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Apr 2026 16:28:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] feat(def): add section skip optimization and performance
 improvements
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

## Optimizations Completed

### 1. Buffer Size Optimization
- IN_BUF_SIZE: 16KB → 256KB
- Reduces I/O syscalls from 2.6% to 1.6% (profiling data)

### 2. IncCurPos Inline Optimization
- Moved implementation to header file for inlining
- Added IncCurPosN() for batch operations

### 3. Section Skip Feature (NEW)
- Added API: defrSetSkipComponents(), defrSetSkipNets(), defrSetSkipSpecialNets()
- Skip unwanted sections during parsing for significant performance gain
- Works with both regular and gzipped DEF files
- Implemented in lexer layer for efficiency

### 4. Makefile Automation
- Added perf target for performance test binary
- Added perf_prof target for profiling binary
- Added PROFLIB variable for profiler linking

### 5. Test Programs
- defrw_skip_test.cpp: Section skip performance test
- defrw_section_test.cpp: Multi-mode section test

## Performance Results (Galaxy_large.def 925MB)

| Optimization | Time (s) | vs 6.0 |
|--------------|----------|--------|
| 6.0 baseline | 17.03 | - |
| 6.1 full parse | 13.37 | +21.5% |
| 6.1 + NetNameCbk | 11.23 | +34.1% |
| 6.1 + SkipComp | 11.68 | +31.4% |
| 6.1 + SkipComp + SkipSNETS + NetNameCbk | 7.83 | +54.0% |
| 6.1 + SkipComp + SkipNETS | 5.85 | +65.7% |

## API Usage

```cpp
// Parse NETS only, skip COMPONENTS and SPECIALNETS
defrSetSkipComponents(1);
defrSetSkipSpecialNets(1);
defrSetNetCbk(myNetCbk);
defrRead(file, filename, userData, 1);

// Use NetNameCbk for faster net name extraction (16-18% faster)
defrSetNetNameCbk(myNetNameCbk);
```

## Files Modified
- defrSettings.hpp/cpp: Added section skip flags
- defrReader.hpp/cpp: Added skip API functions
- defrData.hpp: Added skip_section() declaration
- def_keywords.cpp: Implemented skip_section() and skip logic
- template.mk: Added PROFLIB for profiler linking
- defrw/Makefile: Added perf and perf_prof targets
