+# Section Skip Performance Test Report
+
+## Test Configuration
+- **Test File**: Galaxy_large.def (925MB)
+- **Test Method**: Parse NETS and SPECIALNETS only, with empty callbacks
+- **Runs per test**: 5
+
+## Test Results
+
