Subject: [PATCH 4/8] feat(def): add ProcessEscapeInTString option for escape
 processing

- Add ProcessEscapeInTString flag to defrSettings
- Add defrSetProcessEscapeInTString() API
- Process escape sequences in T_STRING tokens when enabled
- Default is 0 (disabled) for backward compatibility
---
