Subject: [PATCH 5/8] test(def): add escape processing performance test

- Add generate_test_def.py to create test DEF with 100k escaped names
- Add benchmark_escape.cpp for performance testing
- Test results show <1% overhead with 50% escaped names
- Update .gitignore for test files
